  "term": "Romazicon",
  "definition": "Romazicon is flumazenil, a drug that blocks benzodiazepine action in the central nervous system. It is used to reverse benzodiazepine-related effects such as sedation, memory impairment, slowed psychomotor functioning, and reduced breathing.",
